w/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Nesvig-Trani/StyreIQ/commit/1064110bad65d09e89e065c820c78dece5de4927","node_id":"C_kwDOPNjdpNoAKDEwNjQxMTBiYWQ2NWQwOWU4OWUwNjVjODIwYzc4ZGVjZTVkZTQ5Mjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nesvig-Trani/StyreIQ/commit/ead73545ae8668fd265fe4ada7af6d3a919260d0","sha":"ead73545ae8668fd265fe4ada7af6d3a919260d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nesvig-Trani/StyreIQ/commits/ead73545ae8668fd265fe4ada7af6d3a919260d0"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Nesvig-Trani/StyreIQ/commit/82d83f02c86dcc1e3954acd54c897a80598fee39","sha":"82d83f02c86dcc1e3954acd54c897a80598fee39","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nesvig-Trani/StyreIQ/commits/82d83f02c86dcc1e3954acd54c897a80598fee39"}],"sha":"1064110bad65d09e89e065c820c78dece5de4927","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nesvig-Trani/StyreIQ/commits/1064110bad65d09e89e065c820c78dece5de4927"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/117097727?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KennethOLivasMelt/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KennethOLivasMelt/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KennethOLivasMelt/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KennethOLivasMelt/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/KennethOLivasMelt","id":117097727,"login":"KennethOLivasMelt","node_id":"U_kgDOBvrE_w","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KennethOLivasMelt/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KennethOLivasMelt/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KennethOLivasMelt/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KennethOLivasMelt/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KennethOLivasMelt/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KennethOLivasMelt","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nesvig-Trani/StyreIQ/commits/82d83f02c86dcc1e3954acd54c897a80598fee39/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-03T22:00:45Z","email":"kenneth@meltstudio.co","name":"KennethOlivasMelt"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-03T22:00:45Z","email":"kenneth@meltstudio.co","name":"KennethOlivasMelt"},"message":"fix(server): await compliance task generation in afterChange hook (GIQ-81)\n\nThe task generator was wrapped in a fire-and-forget setTimeout(1000) that\nnever executes in Vercel''s serverless environment — the function is suspended\nonce the HTTP response is sent, so the deferred callback is dropped. This\ncaused newly created users to have zero compliance tasks.\n\nChanges:\n- Remove setTimeout wrapper from the create branch of the Users afterChange\n  hook; await the generator and audit-log write directly so generation\n  completes before the serverless function suspends.\n- Apply the same fix to the role-added update branch for consistency.\n- Restore the post-create redirect to /dashboard/users/access/[id] for\n  non-SuperAdmin users, removed in 7f5f379. The redirect ensures admins\n  configure org access before the new user logs in.\n- Add private/backfill-giq81-compliance-tasks.ts: a one-off idempotent script\n  to generate tasks for existing users with zero compliance tasks.\n  Already run on production (backfilled 1 user, skipped 27).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d68887fddee72065f8eaa86c275a9fccdc9acf83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nesvig-Trani/StyreIQ/git/trees/d68887fddee72065f8eaa86c275a9fccdc9acf83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Nesvig-Trani/StyreIQ/git/commits/82d83f02c86dcc1e3954acd54c897a80598fee39","verification":{"payload":"tree d68887fddee72065f8eaa86c275a9fccdc9acf83\nparent 83b71c25fc3500b6c38267b8e0c7253b60d81cf4\nauthor KennethOlivasMelt <kenneth@meltstudio.co> 1780524045 -0600\ncommitter KennethOlivasMelt <kenneth@meltstudio.co> 1780524045 -0600\n\nfix(server): await compliance task generation in afterChange hook (GIQ-81)\n\nThe task generator was wrapped in a fire-and-forget setTimeout(1000) that\nnever executes in Vercel''s serverless environment — the function is suspended\nonce the HTTP response is sent, so the deferred callback is dropped. This\ncaused newly created users to have zero compliance tasks.\n\nChanges:\n- Remove setTimeout wrapper from the create branch of the Users afterChange\n  hook; await the generator and audit-log write directly so generation\n  completes before the serverless function suspends.\n- Apply the same fix to the role-added update branch for consistency.\n- Restore the post-create redirect to /dashboard/users/access/[id] for\n  non-SuperAdmin users, removed in 7f5f379. The redirect ensures admins\n  configure org access before the new user logs in.\n- Add private/backfill-giq81-compliance-tasks.ts: a one-off idempotent script\n  to generate tasks for existing users with zero compliance tasks.\n  Already run on production (backfilled 1 user, skipped 27).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQGzBAABCAAdFiEE2Quh576cjusIEVXhScbHwE0FqY8FAmogpBYACgkQScbHwE0F\nqY/VOgv9HFRgjExG6y8zd/zgeTbd2wIihyOGXu2J3E1nKryj4S0wVz8GiPsRu05I\nsreWsV1JFVRLytterZODD57PkzyvvXz4RGASRboHIhNi/xpe4A65QUa8I7IiaQTL\nOpX/7oyFGSII94lvHxArNWP+dr+/eXQWbC38tSzAR5ZGOJWCR12i0NSvutN/1CHh\nJR1xw7Jd7s0jvJQl9sVXHZv7pMLyjfBUGW3vbE3VF0sM676oGF19I73xaNAKwNyA\nVCdHMNYBNXk4MIl03JSBioBgufs/ZTR5kPq4ey/OSHN6Tz5HeBM3wnc3C/MkDUi0\ntPau3he6gGMsnV0/9HHSWpuXOPmxu6sBtWBe/eMjo728rrpdNJTFysvLhqyQj+ve\ncWsqXK9b4ozpXcUfnfTQ8AXpyHSSGKa9uU3bIueI8o+YFlqfaEEDpC+YF1nRew6G\nX07MK0RO03FLWJE6fqpFTw9LOrm5+P5kp77gv230OU+LxkbUtfvp79hamyXeSPx+\nelj6yTtu\n=7LoX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-03T22:01:03Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1170