s","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/cc33a2791daa3ddb578bad03f6860a40eee11250/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:27:09Z","email":"viniciusmcruvinel@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:27:09Z","email":"viniciusmcruvinel@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius"},"message":"fix(ai): project-relative file paths, sign-of-life status events and an immediate Stop\n\nThree problems showed up using the --jsonl session from Shepherd Studio:\n\n- No approval card ever appeared: with one project selected the model writes\n  paths relative to it (lib/main.dart), and every one was blocked as ''outside the\n  selected projects''. Such a path is now placed inside the selected project and\n  reported with the project prefix; an explicit path into another existing folder\n  is still blocked, several selected projects require the project folder in the\n  path (and the notice says so), absolute paths and .. stay blocked.\n- The prompt now tells the model the path convention and that the app shows\n  Apply/Discard cards, so it must not ask for approval in text (it wrote\n  ''respond Approved'' and waited).\n- The session went silent for as long as the model took to answer (an Ollama\n  model loading can take a minute) and Stop did nothing until the next chunk.\n  A new status event (phase + seconds quiet) is sent every 5 s of quiet while\n  indexing, searching or waiting for the model, and cancel now races the next\n  chunk so it works while the provider is silent. set_mode is acknowledged with\n  mode_changed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26e3e9f6aa6a35065932c7e1b4d79701cad0fa2a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/trees/26e3e9f6aa6a35065932c7e1b4d79701cad0fa2a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/commits/cc33a2791daa3ddb578bad03f6860a40eee11250","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39386478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv","id":39386478,"login":"cruvinelrv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzg2NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/cc33a2791daa3ddb578bad03f6860a40eee11250","node_id":"C_kwDOPNyTrNoAKGNjMzNhMjc5MWRhYTNkZGI1NzhiYWQwM2Y2ODYwYTQwZWVlMTEyNTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/1c3197cf12be54d437c24d98dd492a7d7cb5b50d","sha":"1c3197cf12be54d437c24d98dd492a7d7cb5b50d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/1c3197cf12be54d437c24d98dd492a7d7cb5b50d"}],"sha":"cc33a2791daa3ddb578bad03f6860a40eee11250","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/cc33a2791daa3ddb578bad03f6860a40eee11250"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39386478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv","id":39386478,"login":"cruvinelrv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzg2NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/f81ce258320417195d2d5d4d25b51ac7fe918129/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:16:54Z","email":"viniciusmcruvinel@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T19:16:54Z","email":"viniciusmcruvinel@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius"},"message":"fix(ai): a project selection never widens the RAG search\n\nWith projects selected but not registered in .shepherd/workspace.yaml, the\nsession indexed the whole workspace as one project and then searched all of it:\nthe filter only applied when the manifest had projects, so a question about one\nproject was answered with content from the others (reproduced with the real CLI:\nselecting ''oficina'' and asking about ''frutas'' returned frutas/receita.html).\n\nThe filter now has three cases: nothing selected -> everything; registered\nprojects -> chunks tagged with the selected project names; no registered projects\n-> the workspace is one project with paths relative to its root, so the selected\nfolder is the first path segment. A selection that matches nothing allows\nnothing instead of falling back to everything.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3bf5c3c5d27ac7a673c024fb9677527a2107dc30","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/trees/3bf5c3c5d27ac7a673c024fb9677527a2107dc30"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/commits/f81ce258320417195d2d5d4d25b51ac7fe918129","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39386478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv","id":39386478,"login":"cruvinelrv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzg2NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/f81ce258320417195d2d5d4d25b51ac7fe918129","node_id":"C_kwDOPNyTrNoAKGY4MWNlMjU4MzIwNDE3MTk1ZDJkNWQ0ZDI1YjUxYWM3ZmU5MTgxMjk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/1c3197cf12be54d437c24d98dd492a7d7cb5b50d","sha":"1c3197cf12be54d437c24d98dd492a7d7cb5b50d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/c