,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzg2NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/cffcb530663d1b4bf98459ca0bc62c9d3120e8de/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:59:47Z","email":"viniciusmcruvinel@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:27:22Z","email":"39386478+cruvinelrv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vinicius Machado"},"message":"feat(ai): set_projects request for the --jsonl session\n\nLets the host change the selected projects mid-conversation without\nrestarting the process, so the conversation history survives. Newly in-scope\nprojects are indexed before the next question.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a13fe14bc38548411cd2ed9e3a63f23aa4aa92c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/trees/4a13fe14bc38548411cd2ed9e3a63f23aa4aa92c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/commits/cffcb530663d1b4bf98459ca0bc62c9d3120e8de","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39386478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv","id":39386478,"login":"cruvinelrv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzg2NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/cffcb530663d1b4bf98459ca0bc62c9d3120e8de","node_id":"C_kwDOPNyTrNoAKGNmZmNiNTMwNjYzZDFiNGJmOTg0NTljYTBiYzYyYzlkMzEyMGU4ZGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/7aa23f7d25a343283fd456889e837f73254d24b4","sha":"7aa23f7d25a343283fd456889e837f73254d24b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/7aa23f7d25a343283fd456889e837f73254d24b4"}],"sha":"cffcb530663d1b4bf98459ca0bc62c9d3120e8de","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/cffcb530663d1b4bf98459ca0bc62c9d3120e8de"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39386478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv","id":39386478,"login":"cruvinelrv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzg2NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/7aa23f7d25a343283fd456889e837f73254d24b4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:23:01Z","email":"viniciusmcruvinel@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:27:22Z","email":"39386478+cruvinelrv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vinicius Machado"},"message":"feat(ai): RAG in the --jsonl session\n\nThe session now indexes the workspace in the background (index_progress /\nindex_done events) and adds the most relevant snippets to every prompt\n(rag_context event), limited to the selected projects. RAG is on by default in\nthis mode whatever the provider: it is the model''s only view of existing files.\n--no-rag turns it off.\n\nProjects come from the .shepherd/workspace.yaml manifest (the host registers\nthem), so chunks are tagged per project and same-named files in different\nprojects do not collide. Without registered projects the workspace is indexed\nas one.\n\nVectors from different embedding backends live in different spaces, so the\nbackend is probed once per session and recorded next to the index: an index\nbuilt by another backend is dropped and rebuilt, and a chunk that would be\nembedded by a fallback backend mid-run (e.g. Ollama timing out) is skipped\ninstead of stored. Files the AI writes are re-indexed after confirm, before\nthe next question.\n\nTests serialize via dart_test.yaml (concurrency: 1) because the new suites\nchdir into a temp workspace, which is process-global.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2c45de14c0894dc70986750680ced3544131712b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/trees/2c45de14c0894dc70986750680ced3544131712b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/commits/7aa23f7d25a343283fd456889e837f73254d24b4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39386478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv","id":39386478,"login":"cruvinelrv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzg2NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/7aa23f7d25a343283fd456889e837f73254d24b4","node_id":"C_kwDOPNyTrNoAKDdhYTIzZjdkMjVhMzQzMjgzZmQ0NTY4ODllODM3ZjczMjU0ZDI0YjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/037d111e3111646009b39cd9ad216bb3127d260d","sha":"037d111e3111646009b39cd9ad216bb3127d260d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/037d111e3111646009b39cd9ad216bb3127d260d"}],"sha":"7aa23f7d25a343283fd456889e837f73254d24b4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/7aa23f7d25a343283fd456889e837f73254d24b4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39386478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv","id":39386478,"login":"cruvinelrv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzg2NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/037d111e3111646009b39cd9ad216bb3127d260d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:16:57Z","email":"viniciusmcruvinel@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:27:22Z","email":"39386478+cruvinelrv@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Vinicius Machado"},"message":"feat(ai): add --jsonl machine protocol and --projects scope\n\nshepherd ai --jsonl runs a long-lived conversation over stdin/stdout, one JSON\nobject per line, so a host such as Shepherd Studio can drive the CLI without\nparsing terminal output. Requests: user_message, confirm, cancel, set_model,\nset_mode, shutdown. Events: ready, text_delta, reasoning_delta, file_started,\nfile_proposal, file_blocked, file_result, usage, done, error. File changes are\nonly proposed; nothing is written until a confirm request approves it, and\npaths outside the workspace or the selected projects are blocked.\n\n--projects a,b restricts the workspace context and the files the model may\nchange to those project folders (empty = whole workspace).\n\nTo share logic with the terminal chat without growing ai_command.dart, the\nprovider/model resolution, workspace-context reading and prompt fragments move\ninto ai_settings_resolver.dart and ai_prompt_builder.dart (ai_