el"},"message":"chore: release v0.10.0 — ai --scope, interactive chat, docs, format\n\nBumps to 0.10.0 (minor: shepherd ai gained a runtime-configurable scope\nand a whole interactive mode since the last release, on top of the\n0.9.x line).\n\n- shepherd ai: new --scope project|workspace (default project, no\n  behavior change for existing usage) controls whether every project\n  in .shepherd/workspace.yaml is included as context, or just the\n  current one.\n- shepherd ai with no prompt, run in a real terminal, now starts an\n  interactive chat (ChatSession-backed, keeps history between turns)\n  instead of printing a usage message.\n- CHANGELOG.md, README.md, README.es.md, README.pt-br.md updated with\n  a new Shepherd AI section (setup, usage, scope) and the bumped\n  `shepherd: ^0.10.0` dependency example.\n- dart format applied repo-wide (picked up one pre-existing formatting\n  drift in init_menu.dart, unrelated to this feature — whitespace only).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cb73ecd25c4dc6322e1d158814bbf7ee3b33b212","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/trees/cb73ecd25c4dc6322e1d158814bbf7ee3b33b212"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/commits/7c74996ce36913fb011fadfd5b882ca82bf3f965","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39386478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv","id":39386478,"login":"cruvinelrv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzg2NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/7c74996ce36913fb011fadfd5b882ca82bf3f965","node_id":"C_kwDOPNyTrNoAKDdjNzQ5OTZjZTM2OTEzZmIwMTFmYWRmZDViODgyY2E4MmJmM2Y5NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/500c49b93254d73725b1911a282a5707740d1543","sha":"500c49b93254d73725b1911a282a5707740d1543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/500c49b93254d73725b1911a282a5707740d1543"}],"sha":"7c74996ce36913fb011fadfd5b882ca82bf3f965","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/7c74996ce36913fb011fadfd5b882ca82bf3f965"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39386478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv","id":39386478,"login":"cruvinelrv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzg2NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/500c49b93254d73725b1911a282a5707740d1543/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:35:15Z","email":"viniciusmcruvinel@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius Cruvinel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T10:35:15Z","email":"viniciusmcruvinel@gmail.com","name":"Vinicius Cruvinel"},"message":"feat: add `shepherd ai` (Gemini) gated behind login, plus AI config and workspace context\n\nNew `shepherd ai \"prompt\"` sends a prompt (CLI args and/or stdin) to\nGemini, streaming the response. Requires an active `shepherd login`\nsession — the login itself is the gate, and once authenticated the\ncommand also pulls in local workspace context (project.yaml,\nenvironments.yaml, devops/domains.yaml, and now workspace.yaml) so\nanswers are grounded in the actual project instead of a bare prompt.\n\n`shepherd ai config` is a new interactive command to set the model and\nAPI key used by `ai`, stored in `.shepherd/ai_config.yaml` — falls back\nto GEMINI_API_KEY when no config exists, so nothing breaks for anyone\nalready using the env var.\n\n`.shepherd/` is where all of this lives (session.yaml, ai_config.yaml),\nsame directory workspace.yaml/project.yaml/config.yaml already use —\nnot a separate global ~/.shepherd, which would''ve been inconsistent\nwith how the rest of the CLI already treats that folder. Since\neverything else there is shared, versionable team config, session.yaml\nand ai_config.yaml get added to .shepherd/.gitignore automatically\n(new ensureShepherdGitignoreEntries helper) so a login token or API key\ncan''t end up committed.\n\nWorkspaceManifest is a new read-only parser for `.shepherd/workspace.yaml`\n— the multi-repo project catalog Shepherd Studio generates — so `ai`\ncan summarize sibling projects (grouped by category) as part of its\ncontext.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b2097229f978a3ec270636fe250954cb80c5972","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/trees/3b2097229f978a3ec270636fe250954cb80c5972"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/git/commits/500c49b93254d73725b1911a282a5707740d1543","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39386478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv","id":39386478,"login":"cruvinelrv","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5Mzg2NDc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/500c49b93254d73725b1911a282a5707740d1543","node_id":"C_kwDOPNyTrNoAKDUwMGM0OWI5MzI1NGQ3MzcyNWIxOTExYTI4MmE1NzA3NzQwZDE1NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commit/e47fd6bbbd3aa7e749916dd02780cae81ba68c1c","sha":"e47fd6bbbd3aa7e749916dd02780cae81ba68c1c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/e47fd6bbbd3aa7e749916dd02780cae81ba68c1c"}],"sha":"500c49b93254d73725b1911a282a5707740d1543","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/cruvinelrv/shepherd/commits/500c49b93254d73725b1911a282a5707740d1543"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39386478?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cruvinelrv/events{/privacy}","foll