FF","id":87695763,"login":"ctrlshiftOFF","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Njk1NzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/093aefbea0ab5a366e90cd49f1fb85ef1708bf3b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T22:03:41Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T22:03:41Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"message":"Remove tag filters and add Strapi proxy\n\nRemove multi-tag filtering and related UI/state: drop tags state and fetch, remove tag query params handling and toggle helpers, remove tag chips from active filters and filter panel, and adjust filters grid. Update tag presentation by removing the leading ''#'' in PostCard and TagList. Refactor fetchStrapi to use a browser proxy (/api/strapi) while using the direct Strapi URL server-side, and only apply next.revalidate on the server. Update Strapi post schema (minified) to make tags not required. Minor import cleanup (removed unused Tag type).","tree":{"sha":"0c846a2359540ba59c806a09a968a50c49a84afa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/trees/0c846a2359540ba59c806a09a968a50c49a84afa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/commits/093aefbea0ab5a366e90cd49f1fb85ef1708bf3b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87695763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctrlshiftOFF","id":87695763,"login":"ctrlshiftOFF","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Njk1NzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commit/093aefbea0ab5a366e90cd49f1fb85ef1708bf3b","node_id":"C_kwDOPOHq7NoAKDA5M2FlZmJlYTBhYjVhMzY2ZTkwY2Q0OWYxZmI4NWVmMTcwOGJmM2I","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commit/969260523974ffe87c7af7f651217eba9f7d14c9","sha":"969260523974ffe87c7af7f651217eba9f7d14c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/969260523974ffe87c7af7f651217eba9f7d14c9"}],"sha":"093aefbea0ab5a366e90cd49f1fb85ef1708bf3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/093aefbea0ab5a366e90cd49f1fb85ef1708bf3b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87695763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctrlshiftOFF","id":87695763,"login":"ctrlshiftOFF","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Njk1NzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/969260523974ffe87c7af7f651217eba9f7d14c9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-12T21:36:24Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-12T21:36:24Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"message":"Markdown newline handling; docs & Strapi bump\n\nUpdate markdownToHtml to normalize CRLFs, convert multiple newlines to paragraph breaks, single newlines to <br>, and wrap output in <p> tags to avoid run-on text. Update roadmap docs to mention importing academic credentials and potential on-chain credential registry in roadmap stages. Bump Strapi updater metadata to 5.36.0 and refresh update/notification timestamps.","tree":{"sha":"de4ca766a8450015ecde4b8f809753936465166d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/trees/de4ca766a8450015ecde4b8f809753936465166d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/commits/969260523974ffe87c7af7f651217eba9f7d14c9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87695763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctrlshiftOFF","id":87695763,"login":"ctrlshiftOFF","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Njk1NzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commit/969260523974ffe87c7af7f651217eba9f7d14c9","node_id":"C_kwDOPOHq7NoAKDk2OTI2MDUyMzk3NGZmZTg3YzdhZjdmNjUxMjE3ZWJhOWY3ZDE0Yzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commit/024f159e55e29c31f3ba0595235b99fcf639d8b6","sha":"024f159e55e29c31f3ba0595235b99fcf639d8b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/024f159e55e29c31f3ba0595235b99fcf639d8b6"}],"sha":"969260523974ffe87c7af7f651217eba9f7d14c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/969260523974ffe87c7af7f651217eba9f7d14c9"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87695763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctrlshiftOFF","id":87695763,"login":"ctrlshiftOFF","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Njk1NzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/024f159e55e29c31f3ba0595235b99fcf639d8b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-05T18:07:34Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-05T18:07:34Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"message":"Configure strapi::cors with allowed origins\n\nAdd explicit strapi::cors middleware with an allowedOrigins array (local and production domains), allowed headers and methods, and keepHeaderOnError enabled. Retains global::cors as a manual header fallback to ensure CORS headers are applied in environments where the built-in middleware might not run.","tree":{"sha":"5e93d5c19187ff7986a899b447fd62358ddf58d7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/trees/5e93d5c19187ff7986a899b447fd62358ddf58d7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/commits/024f159e55e29c31f3ba0595235b99fcf639d8b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87695763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctrlshiftOFF","id":87695763,"login":"ctrlshif