/users/ctrlshiftOFF/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/6d928b5a8e30f8730b0fdcd25b6f02bc40a3e2eb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-05T01:48:28Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-05T01:48:28Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"message":"Add custom CORS middleware and enable it\n\nReplace the built-in strapi::cors config with a custom global::cors middleware. Added strapi/src/middlewares/cors.ts which defines default allowed origins, parses extra origins from CORS_ORIGINS, and sets Access-Control-Allow-* headers (methods, headers, max-age). The middleware handles preflight OPTIONS requests by returning 204 and is registered early in strapi/config/middlewares.ts so headers are applied before the security middleware. This works around issues with strapi::cors in production.","tree":{"sha":"b927027561368e9965ea044c2f98c4118f1c47da","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/trees/b927027561368e9965ea044c2f98c4118f1c47da"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/commits/6d928b5a8e30f8730b0fdcd25b6f02bc40a3e2eb","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87695763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/following{/other_user}","gis