te":"2026-02-04T17:30:00Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"message":"Remove Header import/usage from pages\n\nRemove local Header imports and <Header /> usages from several top-level pages (arquivologia-digital, blog, digital-education-app, internacionalizacao, literatura, metaverso, virtualia, youtube-channel). This cleans up unused imports and centralizes the site header (presumably handled by a global layout) to avoid duplicate rendering and linter warnings.","tree":{"sha":"c63bcf9e85e646d9aecb52854b31eb0de2c03347","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/trees/c63bcf9e85e646d9aecb52854b31eb0de2c03347"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/commits/cc2b45511ae8e305baf4febfe141dfda7592de96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87695763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctrlshiftOFF","id":87695763,"login":"ctrlshiftOFF","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Njk1NzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commit/cc2b45511ae8e305baf4febfe141dfda7592de96","node_id":"C_kwDOPOHq7NoAKGNjMmI0NTUxMWFlOGUzMDViYWY0ZmViZmUxNDFkZmRhNzU5MmRlOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commit/68678a38de9981c7d557e02d171dcd19d848e70c","sha":"68678a38de9981c7d557e02d171dcd19d848e70c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/68678a38de9981c7d557e02d171dcd19d848e70c"}],"sha":"cc2b45511ae8e305baf4febfe141dfda7592de96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/cc2b45511ae8e305baf4febfe141dfda7592de96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87695763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctrlshiftOFF","id":87695763,"login":"ctrlshiftOFF","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Njk1NzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/68678a38de9981c7d557e02d171dcd19d848e70c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-04T17:21:17Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-04T17:21:17Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"message":"Add blog filters context, skeletons and UI\n\nIntroduce blog filtering UX and loading states across the app. Adds a BlogFiltersContext and provider (used in RootLayout) to control a fixed filter panel; updates Header to include search + filter trigger (desktop + mobile) and show active filter state. Blog listing (/blog) now supports multi-select category/tag filters via URL params, clicking outside closes the panel, and builds toggle/clear URLs. Adds PostCardSkeleton and PostListSkeleton components and uses them in Blog pages and suspense fallbacks to improve loading UX. Small component improvements: PostCard gets showLanguageBadge prop; CategoryBadge supports custom href and isSelected state; PostList empty state message updated. Documentation and translations updated to reflect implemented structure and patterns. Adds a ''filter-pulse'' animation in tailwind config. Files added: src/contexts/BlogFiltersContext.tsx, src/components/blog/PostCardSkeleton.tsx, src/components/blog/PostListSkeleton.tsx; many blog/layout/header/pages/components/docs/translations updated to wire the feature and polish copy/structure.","tree":{"sha":"e22641b17bee40b6beb7bfaaabc63485f1dadf5d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/trees/e22641b17bee40b6beb7bfaaabc63485f1dadf5d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/commits/68678a38de9981c7d557e02d171dcd19d848e70c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87695763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctrlshiftOFF","id":87695763,"login":"ctrlshiftOFF","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Njk1NzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commit/68678a38de9981c7d557e02d171dcd19d848e70c","node_id":"C_kwDOPOHq7NoAKDY4Njc4YTM4ZGU5OTgxYzdkNTU3ZTAyZDE3MWRjZDE5ZDg0OGU3MGM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commit/b3edf41deed0b7d7febc1202dcfe57734a6de362","sha":"b3edf41deed0b7d7febc1202dcfe57734a6de362","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/b3edf41deed0b7d7febc1202dcfe57734a6de362"}],"sha":"68678a38de9981c7d557e02d171dcd19d848e70c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/68678a38de9981c7d557e02d171dcd19d848e70c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/87695763?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ctrlshiftOFF","id":87695763,"login":"ctrlshiftOFF","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg3Njk1NzYz","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ctrlshiftOFF","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/commits/b3edf41deed0b7d7febc1202dcfe57734a6de362/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-02-04T15:14:51Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-02-04T15:14:51Z","email":"donteatyourprettypet@gmail.com","name":"OFF"},"message":"Refactor LatestPosts UI, skeleton & empty state\n\nRevamp LatestPosts layout and loading/empty behaviors: add Suspense wrapper and useSearchParams to support a preview query param (preview=empty) that shows a minimalist slogan/tagline. Replace previous multi-state AnimatePresence branches with a clearer isEmpty/loading/posts flow, add a 3-card skeleton grid while loading, and render up to 3 posts in a responsive grid. Adjust getPosts call to use ''pt-BR'' (removed language dependency) and simplify language usage in this component.\n\nOther changes: update blog language link to use ''en-US'' and compare languageFilter to ''en-US''; refactor PostCard to avoid nested anchors (image is now wrapped by Link, badges are outside the Link) and normalize language badge label to treat ''en'' and ''en-US'' as ''EN''. SloganLoader now splits the translated title into two parts for static display. Update translations keys: empty_state.description -> empty_state.tagline (PT/EN) and provide new tagline strings. Also make the \"sobre\" section min-h-screen and vertically centered.\n\nNotes: Translation key rename may require updating other usages; language handling was simplified for this commit.","tree":{"sha":"9c8c3b7fe9f42667079f6296f3edb7e085338fc2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/trees/9c8c3b7fe9f42667079f6296f3edb7e085338fc2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Investigacao-Filosofica/giflabs/git/commits/b3edf41deed0b7d7febc1202dcfe57734a6de362","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned