5-07-24T05:09:00Z","email":"jds86@live.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-24T05:09:00Z","email":"jds86@live.com","name":"JD"},"message":"feat: Add IPFS/Filecoin integration and comprehensive testing framework\n\n## New Features:\n- **IPFS Service Integration**: Complete IPFS service with Filecoin/IPFS integration\n- **Testing Framework**: Added Jest configuration and comprehensive test suites\n- **Documentation**: Added detailed IPFS implementation guide and Filecoin setup instructions\n- **Test Scripts**: Added IPFS/Filecoin testing utilities\n\n## Files Added:\n- FILECOIN_SETUP.md - Complete Filecoin network setup guide\n- IPFS_IMPLEMENTATION_SUMMARY.md - IPFS integration overview\n- docs/IPFS_SERVICE_API.md - Detailed IPFS service API documentation\n- jest.config.json - Jest testing configuration\n- scripts/test-ipfs-filecoin.ts - IPFS/Filecoin testing utilities\n- tests/ipfs.service.test.ts - Comprehensive IPFS service tests\n- tests/setup.ts - Test environment setup\n\n## Files Modified:\n- package.json - Added Jest and testing dependencies\n- package-lock.json - Updated dependency lock file\n- src/services/ipfs.service.ts - Enhanced IPFS service implementation\n\n## Testing:\n- Unit tests for IPFS service functionality\n- Integration tests for Filecoin network connectivity\n- Mock implementations for testing without network dependency\n\nThis commit significantly enhances the project''s storage capabilities with decentralized\nIPFS/Filecoin integration and establishes a robust testing infrastructure.","tree":{"sha":"74c39af725fd1f79643d9c5a31617330918a2895","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jds207/top-dog-arena/git/trees/74c39af725fd1f79643d9c5a31617330918a2895"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jds207/top-dog-arena/git/commits/fb9a8e76301b2bb3e25f7bf3a5d2890ebffcb4fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser