alStorage contamination with old URL schemes\n\n Documentation:\n- Added complete project directory structure guide\n- Defined service architecture and port allocation\n- Established development guidelines and naming conventions\n- Documented current status and next steps\n\n Big Dog NFT:\n- All components ready for flip animation functionality\n- Local asset paths properly configured\n- No external dependencies for image loading","tree":{"sha":"dbdfb48a2b95b117a6bd332b13daef53a52b785b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jds207/top-dog-arena/git/trees/dbdfb48a2b95b117a6bd332b13daef53a52b785b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jds207/top-dog-arena/git/commits/638fe310d11f49dd72c52d6957eab9ae597e9a5d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8499674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jds207","id":8499674,"login":"Jds207","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTk2NzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jds207/top-dog-arena/commit/638fe310d11f49dd72c52d6957eab9ae597e9a5d","node_id":"C_kwDOPOfS9NoAKDYzOGZlMzEwZDExZjQ5ZGQ3MmM1MmQ2OTU3ZWFiOWFlNTk3ZTlhNWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jds207/top-dog-arena/commit/8eb9d2f