dd big-dog-front.png and big-dog-back.png to assets\n- Create local SVG placeholders for all NFT characters\n- Add collection banner images for champions and cyber warriors\n- Replace all via.placeholder.com URLs with local assets\n\n Network Fixes:\n- Resolve ERR_NAME_NOT_RESOLVED errors from external placeholders\n- Improve loading performance with local asset optimization\n- Ensure offline functionality without external dependencies\n\n UI Enhancements:\n- Add Big Dog showcase with gradient background and animations\n- Implement CSS 3D transforms for smooth card flipping\n- Add hover effects and flip indicators\n- Style legendary rarity with golden color scheme\n\n Technical Improvements:\n- Add closeModals() method to fix template binding errors\n- Update imports for FlippableNftCardComponent\n- Maintain consistency with existing marketplace design\n- Optimize bundle size by removing external URL dependencies","tree":{"sha":"ea25326fd0d09e8bb51c7404576f400b95ada953","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jds207/top-dog-arena/git/trees/ea25326fd0d09e8bb51c7404576f400b95ada953"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jds207/top-dog-arena/git/commits/8eb9d2f954d09a771c220c403ff46c1160df1159","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8499674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jds207","id":8499674,"login":"Jds207","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTk2NzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/repos","site_admin":false,