"},"message":"Implement mobile-ready shell application with header, footer, and navigation\n\nFeatures:\n- Responsive mobile-first design with hamburger menu\n- Sticky header with proper mobile breakpoints\n- Professional footer with quick links and social connections\n- Enhanced home page with feature cards and call-to-action sections\n- Smooth animations and hover effects\n- Accessibility improvements with proper focus states\n- Theme-aware styling using CSS custom properties\n- Mobile menu with proper ARIA attributes\n\nTechnical improvements:\n- Signal-based state management for mobile menu\n- Optimized touch targets for mobile devices\n- Progressive enhancement with graceful degradation\n- Print-friendly styles\n- Backdrop blur effects where supported\n\nThis provides a solid foundation for the Top Dog Arena platform with\nexcellent user experience across all device sizes.","tree":{"sha":"1ebd09b08daf64a7efd95a18d192e7c0f09a2489","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jds207/top-dog-arena/git/trees/1ebd09b08daf64a7efd95a18d192e7c0f09a2489"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jds207/top-dog-arena/git/commits/ecd77aedf35ce7e1d75e6a361cd37b696240399c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8499674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Jds207","id":8499674,"login":"Jds207","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg0OTk2NzQ=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.co