ve.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-18T21:42:32Z","email":"jds86@live.com","name":"JD"},"message":"feat: Extract HTML templates and implement Jest testing framework\n\n Major Refactoring:\n-  Extracted inline HTML templates to external .html files for 6 components\n-  Updated templateUrl references in all components\n-  Improved separation of concerns and maintainability\n\n Testing Framework Upgrade:\n-  Migrated from Jasmine/Karma to Jest for better performance\n-  Added comprehensive unit tests for all refactored components\n-  24 total tests covering DOM rendering and component behavior\n-  All tests passing with proper Jest configuration\n\n Components Updated:\n- home.component (hero section + feature cards)\n- theme-selector.component (interactive theme picker)\n- remote-wrapper.component (microfrontend wrapper)\n- local-landing-page.component (features & getting started)\n- ssr-placeholder.component (loading placeholder)\n- landing-page.component (player-landing-page project)\n\n Configuration:\n- Added Jest configuration with Angular preset\n- Updated package.json scripts for Jest testing\n- Fixed zone.js compatibility issues\n- Added TypeScript configuration for Jest\n\n Benefits:\n- Better code organization with external templates\n- Superior testing framework with Jest\n- Improved maintainability and readability\n- Comprehensive test coverage for critical components","tree":{"sha":"b48ec3be8cf73a4f9c1a1aec6d526655247d1bf7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jds207/top-dog-arena/git/trees/b48ec3be8cf73a4f9c1a1aec6d526655247d1bf7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jds207/top-dog-arena/git/commits/9d18c3148e5a402436d07a948a711fb25b62c8a1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8499674?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.githu