s/Jds207/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Jds207","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jds207/top-dog-arena/commits/f5b44044c2f1f19941013adb372747b76c181692/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-18T20:09:16Z","email":"jds86@live.com","name":"JD"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-18T20:09:16Z","email":"jds86@live.com","name":"JD"},"message":"feat: Add NFT marketplace and XRPLE/Flare smart contract roadmap\n\n- Add comprehensive NFT marketplace features to roadmap:\n  * Buy/sell interface with auction system\n  * Bid management and notifications\n  * Price history and market analytics\n  * Featured marketplace listings\n  * Search and filtering capabilities\n\n- Integrate XRPLE + Flare smart contract development:\n  * Deploy smart contracts on Flare network\n  * Cross-chain functionality (XRP  Flare)\n  * Gas optimization strategies\n  * Contract security auditing\n  * Web3 wallet integration (MetaMask, XUMM)\n\n- Add technical infrastructure requirements:\n  * Blockchain event listeners\n  * Real-time price updates\n  * Transaction monitoring\n  * Off-chain metadata management\n  * Marketplace API endpoints\n\n- Update sprint planning across all phases:\n  * Sprint 2: Marketplace UI/UX and XRPLE integration\n  * Sprint 3: Backend APIs and smart contract deployment\n  * Sprint 4: Security measures and contract testing\n\n- Create structured TODO list with priority levels:\n  * HIGH: Blockchain marketplace & smart contracts\n  * MEDIUM: Existing website and backend features\n  * LOW: Design and marketing tasks\n\nThis establishes a clear development path for building a comprehensive\nNFT trading platform on the XRP Ledger with Flare smart contracts.","tree":{"sha":"ddd31aebb2db0f6a3ce5e95a8679eaeace9f6998","url":"https://api.g