4T22:35:05Z","email":"anna.grateki@al.infnet.edu.br","name":"Grateki"},"message":"feat: Dia 03 - Generics & Utility Types completo\n\n✨ Novos recursos:\n- 📘 Material teórico completo sobre Generics & Utility Types\n- 🏋️ 10 exercícios práticos com TODO para implementação\n- 🎯 Exemplos.ts estruturado para aprendizado\n- 📚 Guia completo de configuração Angular (AppModule vs Standalone)\n- 🔧 Tsconfig.json configurado para execução\n- 🚀 Script npm run exemplos:dia03 funcionando\n- 📱 App Angular semana-01-anime criado e rodando\n\n📄 Arquivos adicionados:\n- docs/semana-01/dia-03/README.md (teoria completa)\n- docs/semana-01/dia-03/exemplos.ts (exercícios TODO)\n- docs/semana-01/dia-03/exercicios.md (instruções detalhadas)\n- docs/semana-01/dia-03/configuracao-angular.md (guia prático)\n- docs/semana-01/dia-03/tsconfig.json (configuração)\n- apps/semana-01-anime/* (aplicação Angular completa)\n\n🎌 O Dia 03 está pronto para os alunos aplicarem Generics & Utility Types!","tree":{"sha":"c8c19c131297373f2fc1d3e2a8f850f10560c687","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/git/trees/c8c19c131297373f2fc1d3e2a8f850f10560c687"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/git/commits/254089b024f32b195104fdc0e314e405124d2e27","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54456837?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Grateki","id":54456837,"login":"Grateki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NDU2ODM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/commit/254089b024f32b195104fdc0e314e405124d2e27","node_id":"C_kwDOPOfhQNoAKDI1NDA4OWIwMjRmMzJiMTk1MTA0ZmRjMGUzMTRlNDA1MTI0ZDJlMjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/commit/7a227f924ba6e7eed053c567acbb5587c841b5a2","sha":"7a227f924ba6e7eed053c567acbb5587c841b5a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/commits/7a227f924ba6e7eed053c567acbb5587c841b5a2"}],"sha":"254089b024f32b195104fdc0e314e405124d2e27","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/commits/254089b024f32b195104fdc0e314e405124d2e27"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54456837?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Grateki","id":54456837,"login":"Grateki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NDU2ODM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/commits/7a227f924ba6e7eed053c567acbb5587c841b5a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-22T23:20:45Z","email":"anna.grateki@al.infnet.edu.br","name":"Grateki"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-22T23:20:45Z","email":"anna.grateki@al.infnet.edu.br","name":"Grateki"},"message":"📘 Dia 02: Comande seu Exército - Classes, Herança & Constructors\n\n✨ Implementação completa do material didático sobre OOP:\n\n🧱 Classes Fundamentais:\n• Explicação conceitual com analogias (fábrica, RPG, Pokémon)\n• Estrutura completa: propriedades, constructor, métodos\n• Comparação procedural vs orientado a objetos\n• Classes vs objetos vs funções - quando usar cada um\n\n🔒 Convenções e Encapsulamento:\n• Detalhamento da convenção underscore (_) para propriedades privadas\n• Modificadores de acesso (private, protected, public)\n• Getters e setters com validação\n• Benefícios do encapsulamento com exemplos práticos\n\n🏗️ Constructors Avançados:\n• Ciclo de vida detalhado do constructor\n• Comparação com/sem constructor\n• Validação robusta na criação de objetos\n• Dependency Injection com interfaces\n• Builder Pattern para objetos complexos\n• Factory Methods vs constructor direto\n\n👥 Herança e Polimorfismo:\n• Classes abstratas e implementação obrigatória\n• Especialização de unidades (Arqueiro, Mago, Guerreiro)\n• Sobrescrita de métodos (method overriding)\n• Analogias com sistemas RTS\n\n⚙️ Métodos Avançados:\n• Parâmetros opcionais e valores padrão\n• Rest parameters para múltiplos argumentos\n• Sobrecarga de métodos (method overloading)\n• Composição vs herança\n\n💡 Boas Práticas:\n• Princípios SOLID básicos\n• Padrões de design (Builder, Factory, Dependency Injection)\n• Dicas de performance e manutenibilidade\n• Exemplos de código limpo e profissional\n\n🎮 Analogias Didáticas:\n• Sistema de Pokémon para demonstrar classes\n• RPG para explicar constructors e atributos\n• RTS para mostrar herança e polimorfismo\n• Exemplos práticos e funcionais\n\n📚 Material completo com:\n• Mais de 1700 linhas de conteúdo teórico\n• Códigos funcionais e testáveis\n• Tabelas comparativas e resumos\n• Exercícios práticos organizados por dificuldade\n\nReady for: Exercícios práticos e Dia 03 - Generics!","tree":{"sha":"5569cf6d928c30d81c5ed3665096451f2ee75e80","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/git/trees/5569cf6d928c30d81c5ed3665096451f2ee75e80"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/git/commits/7a227f924ba6e7eed053c567acbb5587c841b5a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/54456837?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Grateki","id":54456837,"login":"Grateki","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0NDU2ODM3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Grateki","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/commit/7a227f924ba6e7eed053c567acbb5587c841b5a2","node_id":"C_kwDOPOfhQNoAKDdhMjI3ZjkyNGJhNmU3ZWVkMDUzYzU2N2FjYmI1NTg3Yzg0MWI1YTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/commit/02900e2b58d34cc30539a63a0411987dc74190f5","sha":"02900e2b58d34cc30539a63a0411987dc74190f5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Grateki/jornada-30-dias-angular/commits/02900e2b58d