oad-dirs): add .gitkeep files to keep empty upload directories in repo\n\n- Added  files to  and  to ensure these directories are tracked by Git even when empty.\n- This allows the upload folder structure to remain visible in the repository.","tree":{"sha":"6811462a5da201de6a65503f6c926c6921bbaea8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/git/trees/6811462a5da201de6a65503f6c926c6921bbaea8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/git/commits/9aecdf94244c83d0e7ceb98cd3d035e81b385ec6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114657827?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu","id":114657827,"login":"YakupHadutoglu","node_id":"U_kgDOBtWKIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commit/9aecdf94244c83d0e7ceb98cd3d035e81b385ec6","node_id":"C_kwDOPPKKzNoAKDlhZWNkZjk0MjQ0YzgzZDBlN2NlYjk4Y2QzZDAzNWU4MWIzODVlYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commit/6f4e9172ef378e00c532185cffe5fd24d5c5b960","sha":"6f4e9172ef378e00c532185cffe5fd24d5c5b960","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/6f4e9172ef378e00c532185cffe5fd24d5c5b960"}],"sha":"9aecdf94244c83d0e7ceb98cd3d035e81b385ec6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/9aecdf94244c83d0e7ceb98cd3d035e81b385ec6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114657827?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu","id":114657827,"login":"YakupHadutoglu","node_id":"U_kgDOBtWKIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/6f4e9172ef378e00c532185cffe5fd24d5c5b960/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-04T07:10:09Z","email":"yakuphad2004@gmail.com","name":"YakupHadutoglu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-04T07:10:09Z","email":"yakuphad2004@gmail.com","name":"YakupHadutoglu"},"message":"docs(logging): explain how daily log files are automatically created and why the logs/ folder is tracked\n\nThis update improves the documentation by clearly explaining how the logging system works with Winston and DailyRotateFile.\n\nEach day, three separate log files are automatically created in the logs/ directory:\n- access logs → logs/yyyy-mm-dd-access.log\n- error logs → logs/yyyy-mm-dd-error.log\n- combined logs → logs/yyyy-mm-dd-combined.log\n\nFor example, on August 4, 2025, the following files will be created:\n- logs/2025-08-04-access.log\n- logs/2025-08-04-error.log\n- logs/2025-08-04-combined.log\n\nThese files help with debugging, auditing, and performance tracking by organizing logs chronologically and separating them by purpose.\n\n📌 Note: Although it''s common to exclude the logs/ directory from version control (using .gitignore), in this case it has been intentionally committed. This is done to showcase how the logging system is structured and to provide a working example for contributors or others who may want to implement a similar setup","tree":{"sha":"e45d5c9a3b09e8bab1b467847883c26d4626560f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/git/trees/e45d5c9a3b09e8bab1b467847883c26d4626560f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/git/commits/6f4e9172ef378e00c532185cffe5fd24d5c5b960","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114657827?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu","id":114657827,"login":"YakupHadutoglu","node_id":"U_kgDOBtWKIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commit/6f4e9172ef378e00c532185cffe5fd24d5c5b960","node_id":"C_kwDOPPKKzNoAKDZmNGU5MTcyZWYzNzhlMDBjNTMyMTg1Y2ZmZTVmZDI0ZDVjNWI5NjA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commit/30b0811f5ded1b58942905be9a8057fdae963adf","sha":"30b0811f5ded1b58942905be9a8057fdae963adf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/30b0811f5ded1b58942905be9a8057fdae963adf"}],"sha":"6f4e9172ef378e00c532185cffe5fd24d5c5b960","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/6f4e9172ef378e00c532185cffe5fd24d5c5b960"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114657827?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu","id":114657827,"login":"YakupHadutoglu","node_id":"U_kgDOBtWKIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/30b0811f5ded1b58942905be9a8057fdae963adf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-03T18:05:53Z","email":"yakuphad2004@gmail.com","name":"YakupHadutoglu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-03T18:05:53Z","email":"yakuphad2004@gmail.com","name":"YakupHadutoglu"},"message":"feat(logging): add structured HTTP request logging with geoip and user context\n\n- Added requestLogger middleware to log incoming HTTP requests with IP, user info, user-agent, referer, timestamp, and GeoIP lookup.\n- Integrated Morgan with Winston and DailyRotateFile to write detailed access logs to logs/%DATE%-access.log.\n- Enabled ''trust proxy'' in Express to capture correct client IPs behind proxies.\n- Refactored logger.ts to include ''http'' level logs and custom console/file formats.\n- Added accessTransport for handling access logs separately in rotating files.\n\nNote: Although the ''logs/'' directory is typically ignored in version control (e.g. via .gitignore), it is intentionally committed in this open source project to demonstrate and document the logging system setup clearly.","tree":{"sha":"07c8512c15c41c5dd691ee7931401bc1f25aa776","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/git/trees/07c8512c15c41c5dd691ee7931401bc1f25aa776"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/git/commits/30b0811f5ded1b58942905be9a8057fdae963adf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114657827?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu","id":114657827,"login":"YakupHadutoglu","node_id":"U_kgDOBtWKIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commit/30b0811f5ded1b58942905be9a8057fdae963adf","node_id":"C_kwDOPPKKzNoAKDMwYjA4MTFmNWRlZDFiNTg5NDI5MDViZTlhODA1N2ZkYWU5NjNhZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commit/850c8dbaab615009075b6769d32bb9f576ccfaad","sha":"850c8dbaab615009075b6769d32bb9f576ccfaad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/850c8dbaab615009075b6769d32bb9f576ccfaad"}],"sha":"30b0811f5ded1b58942905be9a8057fdae963adf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/30b0811f5ded1b58942905be9a8057fdae963adf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114657827?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu","id":114657827,"login":"YakupHadutoglu","node_id":"U_kgDOBtWKIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/850c8dbaab615009075b6769d32bb9f576ccfaad/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-02T19:23:51Z","email":"yakuphad2004@gmail.com","name":"YakupHadutoglu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-02T19:23:51Z","email":"yakuphad2004@gmail.com","name":"YakupHadutoglu"},"message":"feat(logs): add rotating log system and custom sanitize middleware\n\n- Integrated Winston logger with DailyRotateFile to store access, error, and combined logs in the ''logs/'' directory.\n\n- Added ''utils/logger.ts'' to handle logger setup.\n\n- In app.ts:\n\n  - Morgan writes access logs to ''logs/access.log'' via a custom stream.\n\n  - Automatically creates the ''logs'' directory if it does not exist.\n\n  - Removed ''mongoSanitize'' and replaced it with a custom ''sanitizeRequest'' middleware.\n\n- The new ''sanitizeRequest'' middleware cleans req.body, req.query, and req.params.\n\n- Enhanced JWT authentication middleware:\n\n  - Removed direct usage of jwt.verify and replaced it with a ''verifyAccessToken'' helper function.\n\n  - Removed outdated token validation logic.\n\n- Temporarily disabled CSRF protection in login and register routes (to ensure uninterrupted testing during development).\n\n- Log output verified using `tail -f logs/access.log`.\n\nNote: Although the ''logs/'' directory is typically ignored in version control (e.g. via .gitignore), it is intentionally committed in this open source project to demonstrate and document the logging system setup clearly.\n\nAudit JSON and rotating log files are automatically created by the logger.","tree":{"sha":"1049c46444482e9239529ddca30c7f2657e2c5f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/git/trees/1049c46444482e9239529ddca30c7f2657e2c5f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/git/commits/850c8dbaab615009075b6769d32bb9f576ccfaad","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114657827?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu","id":114657827,"login":"YakupHadutoglu","node_id":"U_kgDOBtWKIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commit/850c8dbaab615009075b6769d32bb9f576ccfaad","node_id":"C_kwDOPPKKzNoAKDg1MGM4ZGJhYWI2MTUwMDkwNzViNjc2OWQzMmJiOWY1NzZjY2ZhYWQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commit/32493c882dddaa1a50a91dae989ddd90bbd03943","sha":"32493c882dddaa1a50a91dae989ddd90bbd03943","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/32493c882dddaa1a50a91dae989ddd90bbd03943"}],"sha":"850c8dbaab615009075b6769d32bb9f576ccfaad","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/850c8dbaab615009075b6769d32bb9f576ccfaad"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114657827?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu","id":114657827,"login":"YakupHadutoglu","node_id":"U_kgDOBtWKIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/32493c882dddaa1a50a91dae989ddd90bbd03943/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-08-02T15:42:01Z","email":"yakuphad2004@gmail.com","name":"YakupHadutoglu"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-08-02T15:42:01Z","email":"yakuphad2004@gmail.com","name":"YakupHadutoglu"},"message":"feat(security): Add CSRF protection to API endpoints\n\nThis commit introduces a robust Cross-Site Request Forgery (CSRF) protection mechanism\nto key API routes, significantly enhancing the security of the application.\n\n- A dedicated route  was created to generate and issue a new CSRF token.\n- A utility function  was implemented using Node.js''s  module.\n- A middleware  validates incoming requests based on token presence.\n- Applied CSRF middleware to the following routes:\n  - POST /auth/register\n  - POST /auth/login\n  - POST /auth/logout\n  - POST /token/refresh-token\n- Cookies configured with HttpOnly, sameSite and dynamic secure flag based on NODE_ENV.","tree":{"sha":"c12232741f4935ba9d84d0b1e39197d9d81dbfc7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/git/trees/c12232741f4935ba9d84d0b1e39197d9d81dbfc7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/git/commits/32493c882dddaa1a50a91dae989ddd90bbd03943","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/114657827?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu","id":114657827,"login":"YakupHadutoglu","node_id":"U_kgDOBtWKIw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YakupHadutoglu","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commit/32493c882dddaa1a50a91dae989ddd90bbd03943","node_id":"C_kwDOPPKKzNoAKDMyNDkzYzg4MmRkZGFhMWE1MGE5MWRhZTk4OWRkZDkwYmJkMDM5NDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commit/6f59ae441b2abcddff0f5e772dd232b0f9dfaba5","sha":"6f59ae441b2abcddff0f5e772dd232b0f9dfaba5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/YakupHadutoglu/structure-analysis-api/commits/6f59ae441b2abcddff0f5e772dd232b0f9dfaba