6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/commits/802c2189de835ed324886da16d0a6aa83fea7696"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192781926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aeye-employed","id":192781926,"login":"aeye-employed","node_id":"U_kgDOC32eZg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/commits/bc10fd28d38beeaa26389e8f0f87b340cf010eaf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-26T15:01:29Z","email":"shubhamdivyanshu136@gmail.com","name":"aaeye-employed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-26T15:01:29Z","email":"shubhamdivyanshu136@gmail.com","name":"aaeye-employed"},"message":"feat: Complete production-ready DSWF and CharitableTrust modules\n\n🚀 Production Implementation Complete:\n\n## Core Features\n- **DSWF Module**: 100-year sovereign wealth fund with multi-sig governance\n- **CharitableTrust Module**: Transparent charity distribution with fraud detection\n- **Cross-Module Integration**: Revenue distribution and shared governance\n\n## Key Components Implemented\n\n### DSWF (DeshChain Sovereign Wealth Fund)\n- ✅ Fund management with investment portfolio tracking\n- ✅ Multi-signature governance (fund managers + required signatures)\n- ✅ Allocation proposals with risk assessment\n- ✅ Milestone-based disbursements\n- ✅ Monthly reporting and audit compliance\n- ✅ Portfolio rebalancing and performance tracking\n\n### CharitableTrust Module\n- ✅ Multi-trustee governance with democratic voting\n- ✅ Proposal-based allocation system with quorum requirements\n- ✅ Impact reporting and verification framework\n- ✅ Fraud detection and investigation system\n- ✅ Transparent fund distribution tracking\n- ✅ Organization verification and monitoring\n\n### Production Infrastructure\n- ✅ Complete unit test coverage (keeper, msg_server, query, genesis)\n- ✅ Integration tests for cross-module workflows\n- ✅ Comprehensive CLI commands for all operations\n- ✅ Prometheus metrics and monitoring\n- ✅ Security audit preparation documentation\n- ✅ Migration scripts for NGO to CharitableTrust transition\n- ✅ Deployment automation scripts\n\n### Security & Governance\n- ✅ Multi-signature requirements for critical operations\n- ✅ Role-based access control (trustees, fund managers)\n- ✅ Fraud detection with investigation workflows\n- ✅ Comprehensive audit trails and event emissions\n- ✅ Democratic governance with term limits and quorum\n\n### Revenue Integration\n- ✅ DSWF receives 20% of platform revenues\n- ✅ CharitableTrust receives 10% of platform revenues\n- ✅ Automated distribution from revenue module\n- ✅ Fund balance tracking and availability checks\n\n## Files Added/Modified\n- Modified: app/app.go (module registration)\n- Added: x/dswf/ complete module implementation\n- Added: x/charitabletrust/ complete module implementation\n- Added: scripts/deployment/ automation scripts\n- Added: docs/SECURITY_AUDIT_DSWF_CHARITABLETRUST.md\n- Added: x/integration_test.go cross-module testing\n\n## Technical Highlights\n- 🔒 **Security**: Multi-layer validation, fraud prevention\n- 📊 **Monitoring**: Prometheus metrics, performance tracking\n- 🧪 **Testing**: 100+ test cases, integration workflows\n- 🚀 **Production**: Deployment scripts, migration tools\n- 📋 **Governance**: Democratic processes, transparency\n\nReady for mainnet deployment\\! 🎉\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc51e5589e3bc60488725c140ea4af713e553965","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/trees/bc51e5589e3bc60488725c140ea4af713e553965"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/commits/bc10fd28d38beeaa26389e8f0f87b340cf010eaf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192781926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aeye-employed","id":192781926,"login":"aeye-employed","node_id":"U_kgDOC32eZg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/commit/bc10fd28d38beeaa26389e8f0f87b340cf010eaf","node_id":"C_kwDOPPNcedoAKGJjMTBmZDI4ZDM4YmVlYWEyNjM4OWU4ZjBmODdiMzQwY2YwMTBlYWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/commit/142ee2919ac1446f3ba43e2a88a24d