eter management\n  - Investment strategy with multi-portfolio approach\n  - Performance metrics and ROI tracking\n\n- CharitableTrust Module:\n  - Complete keeper with charitable organization validation\n  - Proposal-based allocation system with trustee voting\n  - Impact reporting with verification system\n  - Fraud detection and investigation framework\n  - Multi-signature governance with 7-member board\n\n- Proto Definitions:\n  - Complete message and query definitions for both modules\n  - Genesis state specifications\n  - Event types for all operations\n\n- Security Features:\n  - Multi-signature requirements for large allocations\n  - Fraud prevention with investigation process\n  - Milestone-based disbursements\n  - Impact verification requirements\n\n- Production Features:\n  - Comprehensive error handling\n  - Event emission for all state changes\n  - Parameter validation\n  - Index management for efficient queries\n\nNext Steps:\n- Implement query handlers\n- Create unit and integration tests\n- Add CLI commands\n- Register modules in app.go\n- Create migration scripts\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e2f998de83016bedb372bec76795b83c26200d1e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/trees/e2f998de83016bedb372bec76795b83c26200d1e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/commits/142ee2919ac1446f3ba43e2a88a24dda7dce5fe8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192781926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/gists{/gist_id}","gravata