riptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/commits/6ed80c05859f6e15ff8e5fca97564b4c63681fd2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-23T16:41:23Z","email":"shubhamdivyanshu136@gmail.com","name":"aaeye-employed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-23T16:41:23Z","email":"shubhamdivyanshu136@gmail.com","name":"aaeye-employed"},"message":"feat: Implement sustainable revenue model for long-term platform viability\n\nMajor changes:\n- Graduated charity allocation (10% Y1 → 40% Y5) for sustainability\n- Sustainable transaction fee structure (0.50% minimum)\n- Performance-based DINR yield (0-8%) replacing guaranteed returns\n- Tiered DINR/DUSD fee structure without artificial caps\n- Revenue tracking module for performance metrics\n- Comprehensive financial risk analysis and projections\n\nKey implementations:\n- x/governance: Added graduated charity allocation system\n- x/tax: Implemented sustainable fee structure with volume discounts\n- x/dinr: Converted to performance-based yield + tiered fees\n- x/dusd: Updated to sustainable 0.30% average fees\n- x/revenue: New module for tracking platform performance\n\nDocumentation:\n- Added comprehensive revenue sustainability analysis\n- Created financial risk assessment with stress tests\n- Developed revised sustainable revenue model\n- Updated whitepaper with sustainable economics\n\nThis ensures DeshChain''s long-term viability while preserving social impact.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"97ede18809baf47927ddeae4849a667ee394ac3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/trees/97ede18809baf47927ddeae4849a667ee394ac3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/commits/6ed80c05859f6e15ff8e5fca97564b4c63681fd2","verification":{"paylo