(Nari Shakti): 50% fee waivers\n   - Healthcare (Swasthya Mitra): 0% emergency loans\n   - Environment (Paryavaran Rakshak): Green project financing\n   - Total commitment: ₹47,277 Cr over 10 years\n\n3. Dynamic Payout System Documentation:\n   - Comprehensive explanation of 8-50% returns\n   - Performance calculation formula\n   - Real-time metrics and examples\n   - Verifier communication framework\n\n4. Pradhan Sevak NFT Implementation:\n   - Unique Genesis Block NFT for PMO gifting\n   - 1000 cultural quotes in 22 languages\n   - Non-transferable, non-burnable properties\n   - 0.01% perpetual royalty to PM CARES Fund\n   - Governance proposal for formal transfer\n   - Complete NFT infrastructure and handlers\n\nTechnical implementation:\n- pradhan_sevak.go: Complete NFT type definition\n- genesis_nft.go: Genesis block minting logic\n- genesis_nft_handler.go: App integration and governance\n- Updated whitepaper with all new features\n\nThis completes the comprehensive DeshChain ecosystem with cultural\ntribute, social impact, and technical innovation combined.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"13d1d8bca2c8c595d96f86fe83f32eaafcd2980b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/trees/13d1d8bca2c8c595d96f86fe83f32eaafcd2980b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/commits/95b451f8b74b454e877ff6185ba6bc8618a94180","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192781926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_u