tps://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/commits/0154f0e84f5d21a9388ca6feb4181f4e61e9793a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-22T17:38:18Z","email":"shubhamdivyanshu136@gmail.com","name":"aaeye-employed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-22T17:38:18Z","email":"shubhamdivyanshu136@gmail.com","name":"aaeye-employed"},"message":"feat: Implement dynamic pension payout system with performance-based returns\n\nMajor changes:\n- Add NAMO token tribute to PM Modi in README\n- Implement dynamic payout system (8-50%) based on chain performance\n- Create comprehensive performance metrics tracking for fraud, writeoffs, and health\n- Add verifier notification system for village, district, state, and national levels\n- Update Gram Suraksha to use performance-based returns instead of fixed 50%\n- Add Pradhan Sevak NFT concept for Genesis Block gift to PMO\n- Enhance README with social causes and key differentiators\n- Integrate chain economics with dynamic payout calculations\n\nTechnical implementation:\n- New performance_metrics.go with chain health scoring\n- Verifier messaging system with role-based notifications\n- Dynamic payout calculation with multiple risk factors\n- Integration between gramsuraksha and moneyorder modules\n- Backward compatible implementation maintaining existing functionality\n\nThis ensures sustainable pension returns while incentivizing good governance\nand fraud prevention across the DeshChain ecosystem.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"90a0ebccdf703e47ae42c87e6d932e17dba5eda5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/trees/90a0ebccdf703e47ae42c