sers/aeye-employed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/commits/c7f0582884af945821031b3f0dfd50ecd770a018/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-20T07:08:16Z","email":"shubhamdivyanshu136@gmail.com","name":"aaeye-employed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-20T07:08:16Z","email":"shubhamdivyanshu136@gmail.com","name":"aaeye-employed"},"message":"feat: Complete Money Order DEX implementation with regulatory compliance\n\nMajor Updates:\n- Renamed all regulatory-sensitive terms to avoid compliance issues:\n  - \"Pension Scheme\" → \"Suraksha Pool\" (Security Fund)\n  - \"Insurance\" → \"Protection Pool\"\n  - \"Agents\" → \"Seva Mitra\" (Service Friends)\n- Implemented comprehensive Money Order DEX platform:\n  - Smart contract escrow with 24-hour auto-refunds\n  - Biometric authentication (5 types)\n  - P2P matching with geographic proximity\n  - Business bulk order processing\n  - Cross-chain support via IBC\n  - Advanced analytics and reporting\n- Added complete documentation suite:\n  - User guide (87 pages)\n  - Interactive tutorials (6 tutorials)\n  - API reference with REST/GraphQL/gRPC\n- Updated README and whitepaper with Money Order DEX details\n- Ensured all naming follows DeFi terminology for regulatory safety\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"8077c53083cce4622ed8c067fb5f6d4be99b4d58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/trees/8077c53083cce4622ed8c067fb5f6d4be99b4d58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/commits/c7f0582884af945821031b3f0dfd50ecd770a018","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192781926?v=4","ev