ployed","id":192781926,"login":"aeye-employed","node_id":"U_kgDOC32eZg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/commits/a444f6c4398cc60d8cd19462420d36909675b6e4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-07-19T15:25:03Z","email":"shubhamdivyanshu136@gmail.com","name":"aaeye-employed"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-07-19T15:25:03Z","email":"shubhamdivyanshu136@gmail.com","name":"aaeye-employed"},"message":"Implement Unified Liquidity Pool - Revolutionary Three-in-One System\n\nMajor Innovation:\n- Created unified liquidity pool connecting Pension, DEX, and Agricultural lending\n- One pool serves three purposes: pension returns, trading liquidity, agricultural credit\n- 12-month rotating liquidity provides sustainable 50% pension returns\n\nTechnical Implementation:\n- Pension liquidity integration with 80/20 working capital split\n- Unified pool with smart allocation (20% reserve, 30% DEX, 40% lending, 10% emergency)\n- Cross-module hooks for seamless integration\n- Automated revenue distribution ensuring pension returns\n\nEconomic Model:\n- Pension contributions: ₹1,000/month for 12 months\n- DEX trading fees: 0.3% generating ~15% APY\n- Agricultural lending: 6-9% rates generating ~25% APY\n- Combined returns: 40% pool yield supporting 50% pension payout\n\nKey Features:\n- Village pool integration for community management\n- Monthly rotation cycle for sustainable liquidity\n- Risk diversification across geography and sectors\n- Smart contract automation for allocation and distribution\n\nTesting:\n- Comprehensive unit tests for pension liquidity\n- Village pool validation tests\n- Fixed rate pool tests\n- 12-month rotation cycle tests\n\nThis revolutionary system uses pension savings as working capital to:\n1. Guarantee 50% returns to pensioners\n2. Provide 6-9% loans to farmers (vs 24-60% from moneylenders)\n3. Create deep liquidity for Money Order DEX\n4. Build sustainable rural financial ecosystem\n\nOne Plan, Three Benefits - true financial inclusion\\! 🇮🇳\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"29820d27d127cdb732fac4a616cfa8147961c296","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/trees/29820d27d127cdb732fac4a616cfa8147961c296"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/commits/a444f6c4398cc60d8cd19462420d36909675b6e4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192781926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aeye-employed","id":192781926,"login":"aeye-employed","node_id":"U_kgDOC32eZg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/use