"email":"shubhamdivyanshu136@gmail.com","name":"aaeye-employed"},"message":"Implement Money Order DEX Module - Complete Phase 1\n\nMajor Features:\n- Created x/moneyorder module replacing x/dex with UPI-style simplicity\n- Implemented fixed rate pools for traditional money order experience\n- Added village pools with panchayat governance for rural communities\n- Integrated AMM pools adapted from Osmosis for professional trading\n- Added cultural integration with festival bonuses and multi-language support\n\nTechnical Implementation:\n- Complete keeper implementation with all core functionality\n- Proto definitions for all message types and services\n- CLI and REST API interfaces\n- gRPC query service with comprehensive endpoints\n- Fee distribution maintaining same structure as x/dex\n- UPI-style addressing (name@deshchain) for simple transfers\n\nCultural Features:\n- Festival period detection with automatic discounts\n- 22 language support with cultural quotes\n- Village pool member discounts\n- Senior citizen discount ready for KYC integration\n- Traditional money order limits (10-50,000 NAMO)\n\nInfrastructure:\n- Removed old x/dex folder completely\n- Updated app.go to register Money Order module\n- Added comprehensive error handling and events\n- Ready for unit testing and frontend development\n\nThis implementation combines the sophistication of modern DEX with the trust and simplicity of traditional Indian money orders, making DeFi accessible to every Indian.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c0a281c0e94e2ed779c8101715492851a4099867","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/trees/c0a281c0e94e2ed779c8101715492851a4099867"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/commits/c0f6fba0a7545b415f426298ae30caffb15c0326","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":nul