dexing\n- Implemented tax and revenue distribution systems\n- Created royalty inheritance framework\n- Added comprehensive proto definitions\n\nDocumentation:\n- Founder governance protection framework\n- Platform and founder sustainability analyses\n- Social impact revenue model\n- Balanced founder allocation proposal\n\nThis ensures the founder can dedicate their life to DeshChain while maintaining community trust and creating massive social impact.\n\n🤖 Generated with [Claude Code](https://claude.ai/code)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9fde84ba80c2bab22c4c684c4ff7dd73f98fe923","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/trees/9fde84ba80c2bab22c4c684c4ff7dd73f98fe923"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/DeshChain/DeshChain-Ecosystem/git/commits/0d3946eb79a1a4be2923fa42efcc9735c4b3a942","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/192781926?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aeye-employed","id":192781926,"login":"aeye-employed","node_id":"U_kgDOC32eZg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aeye-employed","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/De